 Mustang Coyote Green Decals Side After side view", "tag": ""}, {"src": "/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Ford-Mustang-Coyote-2019-Decals-side-vinyl-wrap-Toronto.jpg", "title": "Ford Mustang Coyote 2019 Decals side vinyl wrap Toronto - racing stripes, car outline, personal car wrap, GTA", "tag": ""}, {"src": "/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Ford-Mustang-Coyote-2019-Decals-Personalside-vinyl-wrap-Toronto.jpg", "title": "Ford Mustang Coyote 2019 Decals Personalside vinyl wrap Toronto - racing stripes, lettering, auto tinting, car wrap, GTA", "tag": ""}, {"src": "/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Ford-Mustang-Coyote-2019-Decals-Personal-front-vinyl-wrap-Toronto.jpg", "title": "Ford Mustang Coyote 2019 Decals Personal front vinyl wrap Toronto - racing stripes, auto tinting, full car wrap, partial car wrap, GTA", "tag": ""}, {"src": "/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/VinylWrapToronto-Ford-Mustang-Coyote-Green-Decals-Side-After-scaled-1.jpg", "title": "Vinyl Wrap Toronto Ford Mustang Coyote Green Decals Side After", "tag": ""}], "eid": "4c9998b"}], "padding": "0px 0px 20px 0px", "maxWidth": null, "minHeight": null, "background": "#FFFFFF", "bgImage": null, "bgSize": null, "bgPosition": null, "bgRepeat": null}, {"id": "b45e69d", "blocks": [{"type": "columns", "cols": [{"width": 74.87, "blocks": [{"type": "text", "html": "<h4>Coyote Head Decals</h4> <p>Unless you are a Ford or even a Mustang enthusiast, you might not know about the Ford Coyote engine. They are used only for Mustang GTs and some F-150s currently being built. The customer had already put plenty of time and money into realizing his vision. When the Mustang first arrived, the crew was impressed with the level of detail the customer had already achieved. The green colour was carried through the interior of the car on the dashboard and interior lights. The before and after shows the impact the Coyote head decals add to the green Mustang.</p> <p>When the client stopped by Vinyl Wrap Toronto’s garage, he explained his vision to pay homage to the Coyote engine. The customer worked with our design team to place coyote head decals on both sides of the vehicle. The decals were cut out of Avery Dennison Gloss Black to match the rest of the vehicle’s details.<br/>Placement of the Coyote Head stickers on the Mustang was made easier by using pre-masking tape and the proofs sent to the client. While the Mustang was in the garage, the customer asked for us to add a strip of gloss black to the front bumper.<br/>The customer was super happy with the decals on his Mustang and could not wait to show off the Coyote Head decals.</p> <p>Speak to our installation team about your personalization ideas and dream at <a href=\"tel:416-746-1381\">416-746-1381</a> whether they are small decals, logos, or racing stripes. <a href=\"/car-lettering-and-decals-gta/\">View more decals</a>.</p> <p>Or Visit our garage at <a href=\"https://g.page/vinylwraptoronto?share\"><strong>24 Ronson Dr, Unit #1, Etobicoke, M9W 1B4</strong>.</a></p> <p>If you are looking for any HealthSafetyBoards and or Covid-19 posters, Signs, and Floor Graphics, Visit <a href=\"https://healthsafetyboard.com/\">HealthSafetyBoard.com</a><br/>For Facemasks Visit <a href=\"http://workweartoronto.com/\">WorkwearToronto.com</a> our Workwear and Apparel Shop. Like us on <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/vinylwraptoronto/\">Facebook</a>, Follow us on <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/vinylwraptoronto/\">Instagram</a>, Heart us on <a href=\"https://twitter.com/vinylwraptdot\">Twitter</a> and add a Comment on <a href=\"https://www.pinterest.ca/vinylwrapstoronto/\">Pinterest</a>.</p>", "style": "text-align:start;font-family:\"Poppins\", Sans-serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.5em;font-weight:300", "eid": "85e4764"}, {"type": "postnav", "prev": {"href": "/bmw-r1200-bike-wrap/", "text": "Prev Previous BMW R1200 Bike Wrap Full – Automotive Wraps"}, "next": {"href": "/complete-vinyl-unwrap-porsche-cayman/", "text": "Next Complete Unwrap Porsche Cayman Next"}, "eid":